 "notes": [
  "Designed to match the chosen minimalist concept: a 16x18 ft 2-car porch sits on the left beneath the upper cantilevered grey box, while the drawing room sits near the gate on the right.",
  "The ground-floor parents' bedroom opens directly onto the central TV lounge without climbing any stairs, with its door shifted to the corner to preserve a 10.5 ft solid media wall in the lounge.",
  "The dining room sits right behind the car porch for direct natural light and connects seamlessly to the kitchen and TV lounge.",
  "All 4 bedrooms (1 on the ground floor, 3 on the first floor including the master suite) feature attached bathrooms.",
  "A concrete water tank is positioned on the roof slab right behind the stair tower, keeping the front roof clear for the solar array."
 ],
